<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC soft wheat estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cereals office ONIC issued the following monthly soft wheat estimates (million tonnes). Revisions for 1995/96 marked with *. 96/97 (Aug/Sept)   95/96 (Aug/Sept)</p>
<p> Opening stocks		     2.230		* 3.087</p>
<p> Harvested crop		    33.800		 29.825</p>
<p> Delivered crop		    29.700		*25.946</p>
<p> Non-farm use			12.672		*12.340</p>
<p> Exports to EU			8.000		* 8.613</p>
<p> Commercial export to non-EU    6.700		  3.750</p>
<p> Non-EU commercial flour export 1.985		* 1.803</p>
<p> Final stock			  2.193		  2.230</p>
</text>
